  "body": "**Environment:**\n- OS: Windows 11\n- ART version: 1.26.1\n- Language: Japanese (ja_JP locale)\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Launch ART with Japanese language settings\n2. Open any RAW file\n3. Adjust any parameters in the editor panel\n4. ART crashes immediately\n\n**Workaround found:**\nEditing the Japanese language file located at `languages/Japanese`:\n\n  **Before:**\n  PROFILEPANEL_PCUSTOM;カスタム\n  \n  \n  **After:**\n  PROFILEPANEL_PCUSTOM;custom\n  \n\n**Additional notes:**\n- The crash does NOT occur when using English locale\n\nIs this a known issue? If not, I'd like to submit a Pull Request with this fix. Is that okay with the maintainers?\n",
